 @Dakotajm0726  thats because nvidia didnt launch their 102 die at the launch of touring series but they did with ampere.
RTX 2080 was TU104 and the actual 102 die were 2080ti and titan which were much faster
RTX 3080 was GA102 and NV compared it to regular 2080 (again which was 104 die) to generate more hype with the "up to 2x faster" claim. In reality the 8nm samsung silicon is meh/disappointing and the cards run really hot, next gen tsmc ~5nm should be a massive leap
